{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"gCPU","type":"group","text":"CPU 核心部件","x":30,"y":10,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"P0","type":"text","text":"**PC 程序计数器**\n保存下一条指令地址，IF 时给出地址，执行后 +4","x":60,"y":60,"width":200,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"P1","type":"text","text":"**IR 指令寄存器**\n暂存当前正在处理的指令","x":285,"y":60,"width":200,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"P2","type":"text","text":"**CU 控制单元**\n解析操作码，发控制信号指挥各部件","x":510,"y":60,"width":200,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"P3","type":"text","text":"**通用寄存器组**\n暂存参与运算的数据与结果","x":735,"y":60,"width":200,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"P4","type":"text","text":"**ALU 算术逻辑单元**\n真正做加/减/与/或/比较运算，设标志位","x":960,"y":60,"width":200,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"P5","type":"text","text":"**内存 RAM**\n按地址存取指令与数据","x":1185,"y":60,"width":200,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"gPL","type":"group","text":"经典 5 级流水线（指令完整执行流程）— 取指 → 译码 → 执行 → 访存 → 写回","x":30,"y":260,"width":1380,"height":230,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"S0","type":"text","text":"**① IF 取指**\nPC 给地址→内存读指令→入 IR→PC+4","x":60,"y":310,"width":230,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"S1","type":"text","text":"**② ID 译码**\nCU 解析操作码→从寄存器组读源操作数","x":330,"y":310,"width":230,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"S2","type":"text","text":"**③ EX 执行 ⭐**\n操作数送 ALU 计算→(load/store 时算内存地址)","x":600,"y":310,"width":230,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"S3","type":"text","text":"**④ MEM 访存**\n仅 load/store 真访问内存；运算/分支空走","x":870,"y":310,"width":230,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"S4","type":"text","text":"**⑤ WB 写回**\n把 ALU 结果或内存数据写回寄存器","x":1140,"y":310,"width":230,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"gMEM","type":"group","text":"MEM 什么时候真干活？（关键对比）","x":30,"y":540,"width":1380,"height":190,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"M0","type":"text","text":"**load (读内存)**✔ 必须用 MEM\nEX 用 ALU 算地址 → MEM 真读内存 → WB 写回寄存器","x":60,"y":590,"width":300,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"M1","type":"text","text":"**store (写内存)**✔ 必须用 MEM\nEX 用 ALU 算地址 → MEM 真写内存 → WB 空操作","x":398,"y":590,"width":300,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"M2","type":"text","text":"**运算 add/sub/and…**✘ 不用 MEM\n只在寄存器间运算，MEM 空走、空周期","x":736,"y":590,"width":300,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"M3","type":"text","text":"**分支 beq/bne**✘ 不用 MEM\nALU 比较 + 算跳转目标，改 PC","x":1074,"y":590,"width":300,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"nT","type":"text","text":"**通俗记忆**：取(拿指令)→译(懂指令+拿数据)→算(ALU 干活⭐)→访(需则读写内存)→存(结果放回寄存器)","x":60,"y":790,"width":1320,"height":60,"color":"1"}
	],
